## What a page looks like {#shape}

Two source formats produce the same rendered page. Pick whichever fits the content — JSON for kit-native authoring, Markdown for prose that should drop in unchanged. Code on the left, the actual rendered output on the right.

### JSON source {#shape-json}

Hand-authored or AI-emitted. Every block declares its kind explicitly; nothing has to be guessed. Validated against the kit schema before it ships.

code.src:
{
  "kind": "callout",
  "type": "info",
  "title": "Heads up",
  "content": "Callouts carry one of seven tones: info, tip, note, neutral, success, caution, danger."
}
